OL,3,AHello Kitty maker cuts ties with
OL,4,AJapanese spy drama after China backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanrio, the company behind Hello Kitty,
OL,7,Fhas apologised and ended its
OL,8,Fmerchandise partnership with a
OL,9,Fcontroversial Japanese TV show after
OL,10,Fdrawing backlash in China.
OL,12,FVivant, a popular spy thriller, has
OL,13,Fbeen widely slammed in Chinese state
OL,14,Fmedia and by Chinese social media users
OL,15,Ffor its depiction of Chinese agents
OL,16,Fusing brutal torture tactics on a
OL,17,FJapanese operative.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
