OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHello Kitty maker cuts ties with
OL,4,AJapanese spy drama after China backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe criticism has extended to the
OL,7,Finternationally beloved Hello Kitty and
OL,8,Fher friends, including My Melody and
OL,9,FCinnamoroll, who were featured in
OL,10,Fmerchandise dressed as characters from
OL,11,Fthe show.
OL,13,FSanrio said it terminated its
OL,14,Fcollaboration with Vivant after
OL,15,Fdetermining that it "contained elements
OL,16,Finconsistent with Sanrio's core
OL,17,Fvalues".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
